{"unit_id":"tag:04JR:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为拓扑（topological）群（group）。设<MATH_0002>为离散（discrete）的<MATH_0003>模（module），具有连续（continuous）的<MATH_0004>作用（action）。换言之，<MATH_0005>为对象（object），属于范畴（category）<MATH_0006>，该范畴在定义<REF_0001>中引入。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 右（right）导出函子（derived functors）<MATH_0007>，对应于<MATH_0008>，定义于范畴（category）<MATH_0009>上，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>连续群上同调群（continuous group cohomology groups）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对应于<MATH_0010>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0011>为抽象（abstract）群（group），具有离散（discrete）拓扑（topology），则<MATH_0012>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>群上同调群（group cohomology groups）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，对应于<MATH_0013>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0014>为Galois群（group），则群（groups）<MATH_0015>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>Galois上同调群（Galois cohomology groups）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，对应于<MATH_0016>。\n<STRUCT_0005> 若<MATH_0017>为绝对Galois群（absolute Galois group），对应于域（field）<MATH_0018>，则群（groups）<MATH_0019>有时称为<TEXTITOPEN_0004>Galois上同调群（Galois cohomology groups），对应于<MATH_0020>，以系数（with coefficients）<MATH_0021>计算<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>。在此情形，有时写<MATH_0022>代替<MATH_0023>。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n","allowed_english":["Galois"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topological","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"discrete","target_term":"离散"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"right","target_term":"右"},{"source_term":"derived functors","target_term":"导出函子"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"continuous group cohomology groups","target_term":"连续群上同调群"},{"source_term":"abstract","target_term":"抽象"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"discrete","target_term":"离散"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"group cohomology groups","target_term":"群上同调群"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"groups","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"Galois cohomology groups","target_term":"Galois上同调群"},{"source_term":"absolute Galois group","target_term":"绝对Galois群"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"groups","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"Galois cohomology groups","target_term":"Galois上同调群"},{"source_term":"with coefficients","target_term":"以系数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topological","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群","context":"暂译，包含Galois群的核心词。"},{"source_term":"discrete","target_term":"离散","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"right","target_term":"右","context":"右导出函子。"},{"source_term":"derived functors","target_term":"导出函子","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"continuous group cohomology groups","target_term":"连续群上同调群","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"abstract","target_term":"抽象","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"group cohomology groups","target_term":"群上同调群","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"groups","target_term":"群","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"Galois cohomology groups","target_term":"Galois上同调群","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"absolute Galois group","target_term":"绝对Galois群","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"with coefficients","target_term":"以系数","context":"系数说明。"}],"notes":[]}
